# hunting-grounds-lock.vrs: hunting-grounds D22 (Session 2). hg-lock spawns 6 CHAR_Spider_Forest at hg-in (-1680,
# -1215), about 20 m inside the FarbaneWoods border with DunleyFarmlands (Session 1: Farbane at z -1200, Dunley at -1160).
# `.devhop` pushes them 75 m north into Dunley (their spawn point moved too, so only the lock brings them back); within
# 10 s "[nyar] region lock hg-lock: returned 6, farthest <d> m out" and the 6 are back at hg-in, inside Farbane.
# Spider guid for .devhop: CHAR_Spider_Forest -581295882.
# Needs: the step 3 Release DLL; NyarDevTools (.devtp, .devgo, .devmark, .devhop) and DevChatEcho; the dev events.json
# entries hg-roam, hg-lock, hg-ambush, hg-point, hg-timing (docs/features/HUNTING_GROUNDS.md, Session 2), scope
# FarbaneWoods (the pond is in it, Session 1); [Debug] VerboseLogging = true; Chaos invulnerable
# (`ToggleInvulnerable true`, a Boolean, never false).
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 4
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
chat .nyar event reload
expect-log events: reloaded
chat .devtp -1680 -1215
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 3
chat .devmark hg-in
expect-log \[DEV MARK\] hg-in
chat .devmark hg-lk
expect-log \[DEV MARK\] hg-lk
chat .nyar region here
expect-reply you are in FarbaneWoods
mark
chat .nyar event start hg-lock
expect-log event hg-lock wave 1/1: 6 units queued timeout=30
wait 6
chat .nyar debug here 20
expect-reply CHAR_Spider_Forest hg-lock
shot full hg-lock-spawn
chat .devtp -1680 -1450
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 3
chat .devhop -581295882 0 75 25 hg-lk true
expect-log \[DEV HOP\] moved=6
expect-log region lock hg-lock: returned 6, farthest [0-9]+ m out timeout=12
wait 2
chat .devgo hg-in
expect-log \[DEV TP\] hg-in
wait 3
chat .nyar debug here 30
expect-reply CHAR_Spider_Forest hg-lock
chat .nyar region here
expect-reply you are in FarbaneWoods
chat .nyar status
expect-reply tracked units: 6
shot full hg-lock-back
chat .nyar event stop hg-lock
expect-log event hg-lock stopped
expect-no-log region (lock|hunt) hg-lock timeout=15
chat .nyar status
expect-reply tracked units: 0 timeout=40
